== Part C: cost on a realistic run (20,000 reads, default filters, -l 15)
  --cut_front -f 5         shipped:  18119 reads  1571378 bases | with the fix:  19999 reads  1742512 bases | lost  1880 reads  171134 bases (9.82 %)
  --cut_tail -t 5          shipped:  18084 reads  1569746 bases | with the fix:  19998 reads  1743533 bases | lost  1914 reads  173787 bases (9.97 %)
  --cut_front -f 5 -W 10   shipped:  17827 reads  1428593 bases | with the fix:  19929 reads  1676889 bases | lost  2102 reads  248296 bases (14.81 %)
